  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AJLCOBN.png\" alt=\"doorsmcw\" width=\"1299\" height=\"683\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logo=twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=f&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否曾希望每扇原版门都有更多的木材变种？或者你只是想要一些独特的新门？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果是这样，那么Macaw的门就是为你准备的。这个模组让你可以用所有木材种类制作原版门。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">它还包含了新门，例如：障子门、金属门、监狱门、现代门等等！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在评论区或我们的Macaw的Discord上提出你的建议。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZS7r7pqZzYg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你需要一个服务器吗？点击上方图片，使用我们的代码<strong>sketchmacaw</strong>，首月可享受<strong>25%</strong>折扣，尽情畅玩！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：你有计划向后移植到1.15.2及更低版本吗？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性很小，但也许将来会有一个1.12.2的最终版本。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需注明出处，并引用CurseForge页面即可。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">问：我有翻译文本，应该发送到哪里？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以通过GitHub或我们的Discord服务器提交。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpZJ9zN.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1477\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
